      "content": "it's just constant. like there's no point to any of it. i look at my life and it's just a series of tasks to keep the machine running. i've given everything i have to this career and i'm left with nothing. nothing at all. i just want to sleep and never have to wake up to this noise again. is it even possible to feel anything real anymore?",
